sn11.22:2.4 none
sn11.22:2.5 starts: ‘Here, dear sir,
sn11.22:3.4 starts: until he disappeared right there.
sn21.11:1.4 starts: and addressed the bhikkhus thus:
sn4.23:1.10 starts: A fourth time …
sn4.23:1.14 starts: A sixth time,
sn4.23:1.15 starts: but he fell away from that temporary liberation of mind.
sn35.64:2.8 starts: delight arises.
